---
source: crates/pgt-ddl/src/build/policy.rs
expression: out
---
# all permissive public ifadesiz
[Safe] CREATE POLICY pol ON public.t AS PERMISSIVE FOR ALL TO PUBLIC
WARN: İfadesiz politika: PERMISSIVE tüm satırlara izin verir, RESTRICTIVE etkisizdir.

# select restrictive iki rol using
[Safe] CREATE POLICY pol ON public.t AS RESTRICTIVE FOR SELECT TO a, "Rol B" USING (owner = current_user
)

# insert with check
[Safe] CREATE POLICY pol ON public.t AS PERMISSIVE FOR INSERT TO PUBLIC WITH CHECK (x > 0
)

# update her ikisi + yorum
[Safe] CREATE POLICY pol ON public.t AS PERMISSIVE FOR UPDATE TO PUBLIC USING (x > 0 -- yorum

) WITH CHECK (x < 9
)
[Safe] COMMENT ON POLICY pol ON public.t IS 'it''s'

# delete using
[Safe] CREATE POLICY pol ON public.t AS PERMISSIVE FOR DELETE TO PUBLIC USING (true
)

# tabloda rls kapalı
[Safe] CREATE POLICY pol ON public.t AS PERMISSIVE FOR ALL TO PUBLIC USING (true
)
WARN: Tabloda satır güvenliği kapalı; politika etkili olmaz.

# tabloda rls açık
[Safe] CREATE POLICY pol ON public.t AS PERMISSIVE FOR ALL TO PUBLIC USING (true
)
